sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator (org_admin)
    participant Web as Next.js (web)
    participant API as Fastify (api)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant S3 as Object storage<br/>(bulk-imports bucket)
    participant Worker as BullMQ worker

    Note over Op,Web: 1. Download the template
    Op->>Web: Open Constituents → "Bulk import"
    Web->>API: GET /v1/constituents/bulk-import/template
    API-->>Web: text/csv (10 example rows, header documented)
    Op->>Op: Fill the template in Excel / Numbers / Sheets

    Note over Op,Web: 2. Upload the file
    Op->>Web: Drag-drop the CSV/XLSX (≤ 10 MB)
    Web->>API: POST /v1/constituents/bulk-import (multipart, CSRF token)
    API->>API: requireAuth + requireWrite +<br/>requireFlag(CONSTITUENTS_BULK_IMPORT)
    API->>API: Magic-byte sniff (file-type)<br/>+ filename sanitisation
    API->>S3: PutObject {org_id}/bulk-imports/{job_id}/{name}
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: INSERT bulk_import_files (s3_key, mime, size, …)
    API->>DB: INSERT bulk_import_jobs (status=pending, file_id, requested_by)
    API->>DB: INSERT outbox_events ('constituents.bulk_import_requested', { jobId })
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>Web: 202 + { jobId }
    Web->>Web: Open progress drawer, start polling every 2 s

    Note over Worker,DB: 3. Async parse + per-row insert
    DB->>Worker: outbox relay → BullMQ enqueue
    Worker->>Worker: isFlagEnabled(CONSTITUENTS_BULK_IMPORT)<br/>(defence-in-depth — drop silently if off)
    Worker->>DB: UPDATE jobs SET status='processing'
    Worker->>S3: GetObject (signed URL disabled — server-side fetch only)
    Worker->>Worker: Parse CSV / Excel (exceljs)<br/>+ formula-injection scrub
    loop Per row (under withTenantContext)
      Worker->>Worker: Validate (Zod)
      alt Validation passes
        Worker->>DB: SELECT … dedupe candidates (email, name+postcode)
        alt No duplicate
          Worker->>DB: INSERT constituents (…)
          Worker->>DB: INSERT bulk_import_results (status='created', constituent_id)
        else Duplicate found
          Worker->>DB: INSERT bulk_import_results (status='duplicate', duplicate_of_id, score)
        end
      else Validation fails
        Worker->>DB: INSERT bulk_import_results (status='failed', error_code, error_message)
      end
      Worker->>DB: UPDATE jobs SET processed_rows++, *_count++, updated_at=NOW()
    end
    Worker->>DB: UPDATE jobs SET status=<br/>completed | partial | failed,<br/>completed_at=NOW()

    Note over Op,Web: 4. Operator sees the outcome
    Web->>API: GET /v1/constituents/bulk-import/:id (poll)
    API-->>Web: { status, totalRows, processedRows,<br/>createdCount, duplicateCount, failedCount, … }
    Web->>Web: Status flips → load detail
    Web->>API: GET /v1/constituents/bulk-import/:id/results?status=failed
    API->>DB: SELECT bulk_import_results WHERE job_id = …
    API-->>Web: Per-row error rows + remediation hints
    Web-->>Op: "98 created, 12 duplicates skipped, 4 failed — fix and re-upload"

    Note over Op,S3: 5. Retention (90 days)
    S3->>S3: Lifecycle rule expires<br/>{org_id}/bulk-imports/* objects after 90 d
    DB->>DB: Scheduled sweep soft-deletes<br/>bulk_import_files older than 90 d<br/>+ purges bulk_import_results.row_data
